      "description": "Uses inventory_has because mining (breaking) a sunflower causes it to drop as an item that the player picks up into their inventory. The player starts with no sunflower in inventory, so having at least 1 confirms the task is complete. This is preferred over position-based or mine_block checks because the item reliably ends up in inventory after breaking.",
      "rules": [
        {
